3. LIMITED PERMISSION
Unless a separate written agreement signed by the Licensor says otherwise,
the Recipient may access and use the Licensed Material solely to review and
evaluate it internally. This limited permission is non-exclusive,
non-transferable, revocable to the extent permitted by law, and does not
authorize production or operational use.

4. RESTRICTIONS
Except where mandatory law or an applicable third-party license permits
otherwise, and unless the Licensor gives prior written permission, the
Recipient must not:
(a) use the Licensed Material in production or to provide a service to third
