material.

7. NO WARRANTY
To the maximum extent permitted by applicable law, the Licensed Material is
provided “as is”, without warranties. Nothing in this section excludes or
limits liability that cannot lawfully be excluded or limited.

8. TERMINATION
Permission under this License ends if the Recipient materially breaches it,
